<title>USA: Ligand Pharmaceuticals completes stock sale.</title>
<headline>Ligand Pharmaceuticals completes stock sale.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ligand Pharmaceuticals Inc said it has completed its public offer of 2.75 million shares of common stock at $12.00 per share.</p>
<p>Following the offering, Ligand has just over 31.1 million shares of stock.</p>
<p>The company has granted underwriters an option to purchase up to 412,500 shares to cover over-allotments.</p>
<p>The offering was managed by Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc., Robertson, Stephens &amp; Company LLC and Hambrecht &amp; Quist LLC.</p>
